      "writtenOn": "2024-10-14T15:38:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Although I would recommend just using the UserHandle from the calling context. The typical pattern of having the caller call Context#createContextAsUser; this avoids the need to pass in a userhandle.\n\nAll of the existing APIs in this class passes in a `UserHandle` explicitly, changing only this method to use the user handle from context might be confusing.",
      "parentUuid": "d0a6b7d0_a48a5491",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 893,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 893,
        "endChar": 39
