      "writtenOn": "2024-10-14T15:46:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is just `getServices` and that users a userId int, not a `UserHandle`.  \n\nYou\u0027d need `android.permission.INTERACT_ACROSS_USERS` as a prerequisite for calling this API then; otherwise you\u0027re violating the permission model for cross-user interactions (e.g. see [here](https://source.android.com/docs/devices/admin/multiuser-apps#interacting_with_users)).",
